Subject: [PATCH 10/10] extension file naming: files renamed to the extended
 type's own name or the 'T where <clause>' shape (renames only; Linux x86_64,
 Swift 6.4.2) (coenttb/work#242)

---
 Sources/Layout/{Axis+Layout.swift => Axis where N == 2.swift}     | 0
 .../{Boundary.Corner+Layout.swift => Boundary.Corner.swift}       | 0
 2 files changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)
 rename Sources/Layout/{Axis+Layout.swift => Axis where N == 2.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Layout/Integrations/Boundary/{Boundary.Corner+Layout.swift => Boundary.Corner.swift} (100%)

diff --git a/Sources/Layout/Axis+Layout.swift b/Sources/Layout/Axis where N == 2.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Layout/Axis+Layout.swift
rename to Sources/Layout/Axis where N == 2.swift
diff --git a/Sources/Layout/Integrations/Boundary/Boundary.Corner+Layout.swift b/Sources/Layout/Integrations/Boundary/Boundary.Corner.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Layout/Integrations/Boundary/Boundary.Corner+Layout.swift
rename to Sources/Layout/Integrations/Boundary/Boundary.Corner.swift
